          "hexane"
        ],
        "temperature": "Method A: 55 °C after SeO2; Method B: room temperature after SeO2",
        "time": "Method A: 2 days metal consumption then 1 h at 55 °C; Method B: 1 day then 2 days stirring, crystals after 2 days",
